<title>UK: Argentina sets 1.0 billion ATS March 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina sets 1.0 billion ATS March 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ARGENTINA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN ATS   COUPON     7.0 PCT   MATURITY    18.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.10    PAY DATE  S-30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.10	REOFFER    98.625    SPREAD	+183 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 1.5 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		24.FEB.97</p>
<p>		S=SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX/VIEN  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
